A few words on my former colleagues:
@miramurati was my role model and a courageous leader - she gave me my best piece of management advice to date (make the decision that is fair, not the one that makes people happy).
@bobmcgrewai was the best problem solver I've worked with and is one of those rare individuals who never sought visibility or credit - his impact on OpenAI far exceeds what's externally visible.
@barret_zoph was one of the hardest workers I've ever met - within two years he gained the respect of everyone at OpenAI and built one of our most important research orgs.
I'm going to miss you all!
